    "detailed_description": "The year is 1953. Millions of Korean comrades, most of them men, lie dead at the feet of US-backed capitalists. You were plucked from your kitchen along with the rest of your comrades, and stand ready to defend your country from NATO aggression.<br><br><strong>Protect the DPRK's future in this roguelike FPS</strong><br><br>- Liquidate as many capitalists as possible using North Korea's finest firearms, such as the Kalashnizon!<br><br>- Earn ration tickets, and launder them into USD to buy buffs from allied foreign powers!<br><br>- Battle a variety of bosses who have dishonored the great DPRK!<br><br><strong>Should you do well enough in your struggle against the imperialists, the Dear Leader may just see fit to whisk you away from your peasant life and......</strong>(that's where the breeding comes in ;)).",
